abstract: "Code for supervised learning through internal synaptic-gain adaptation in a MaleCNS Drosophila connectome model with fixed input and output interfaces. Experiments cover Iris classification and regression, and Ki-67 histopathology classification through BRAP-Net with a frozen vision transformer."
keywords:
  - connectomics
  - Drosophila melanogaster
  - synaptic weight adaptation
  - classification
  - regression
